{"id": "a1ce09ae-b895-4d04-b91a-cab8ececabef", "slug": "platform-unified-systems-3", "title": "Platform - Unified Systems", "description": "Platform Unified Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Platform - Unified Systems\"\ndescription: \"Platform Unified Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF5A1F\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF6B00\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform - Unified Systems\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 28; favorites: 10; remixes: 1.\nTags: cta, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, charts, security, billing.\n## Overview\nPlatform Unified Sidebar Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexus Platform Solutions Pricing Enterprise Resources Log in Get Started Unify & Automate Unify your operations into one intelligent platform. Bring fragmented tools together in a single command center. Optimize daily p…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unify your operations into one intelligent platform.; Connections (28); Trending; CodeHub; LedgerX; RepoSync.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF5A1F, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF6B00, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform - Unified Systems</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Hide scrollbar for clean aesthetic */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 0px; background: transparent; }\n\n        /* Premium Border Gradient Utilities */\n        .border-gradient-surface {\n            position: relative;\n            background: rgba(20, 20, 22, 0.8);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n            border-radius: 1rem;\n        }\n        .border-gradient-surface::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: calc(1rem + 1px);\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\n            z-index: -1;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .border-gradient-card {\n            position: relative;\n            background: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.6);\n            border-radius: 0.75rem;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .border-gradient-card::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: calc(0.75rem + 1px);\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), rgba(255,255,255,0));\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n\n        /* 3D Dashboard Perspective Setup */\n        .perspective-container {\n            perspective: 2000px;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n        }\n        .dashboard-plane {\n            transform: rotateX(38deg) rotateY(-12deg) rotateZ(18deg) scale(0.95);\n            box-shadow: -20px 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 60px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.05);\n            /* Transition removed to allow GSAP ScrollTrigger to scrub smoothly without fighting CSS */\n        }\n\n        /* Masked Reveal Setup */\n        .reveal-mask {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-zinc-200 font-sans overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-orange-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Orange God Ray (Top Right) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-[-20%] right-[-10%] w-[60vw] h-[60vw] rounded-full bg-[#ff5a1f]/20 blur-[130px] pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen\" id=\"god-ray\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 right-0 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] rounded-full bg-[#ff5a1f]/10 blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-screen pt-20 pb-32\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6\">\n\n            <!-- Hero Section -->\n            <div class=\"max-w-2xl flex flex-col items-start mb-24 relative z-20\">\n                <!-- Pill Badge -->\n                <div class=\"hero-elem inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#ff5a1f]/30 bg-[#ff5a1f]/5 text-[#ff5a1f] text-xs font-normal mb-6 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:start-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span>Unify & Automate</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Headline (Masked Reveal) -->\n                <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-[1.05]\">\n                    Unify your operations into one intelligent platform.\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Subheadline -->\n                <p class=\"hero-elem text-zinc-400 text-base md:text-lg mb-8 max-w-lg leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                    Bring fragmented tools together in a single command center. Optimize daily processes and empower your team to scale effortlessly without extensive coding.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- CTAs -->\n                <div class=\"hero-elem flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <button class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff5a1f] text-white text-sm font-normal shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,90,31,0.3)] hover:bg-[#ff6a35] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(255,90,31,0.5)] transition-all\">\n                        Start for free\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white text-sm font-normal hover:bg-white/10 transition-all backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                        View demo\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Trusted By Logos Section -->\n                <div class=\"w-full flex flex-col items-start gap-6 mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 relative z-20\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500 font-normal logo-anim-elem\">Trusted by leading engineering teams</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 opacity-70\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400 logo-anim-elem hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Nebula</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400 logo-anim-elem hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-3-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Astro</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400 logo-anim-elem hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:triangle-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Polymath</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-400 logo-anim-elem hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-default hidden sm:flex\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">BlockScale</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Dashboard 3D Mockup -->\n            <div class=\"perspective-container w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-[-5%] relative z-10\">\n\n                <!-- The tilted dashboard plane (straightens on scroll) -->\n                <div class=\"dashboard-plane border-gradient-surface w-full aspect-[16/10] flex overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Sidebar -->\n                    <div class=\"w-16 border-r border-white/5 flex flex-col items-center py-6 gap-6 bg-[#0a0a0c]/50 dash-elem\">\n                        <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:command-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-300\" width=\"18\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff5a1f] bg-[#ff5a1f]/10 relative\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-5-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-2 bottom-2 w-0.5 bg-[#ff5a1f] rounded-r-full\"></div>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 transition\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-rounded-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 transition\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 transition\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Main Dashboard Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col bg-[#111114]/80 backdrop-blur-xl relative\">\n                        <!-- Top subtle glow -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.02] to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Header -->\n                        <div class=\"px-8 py-8 border-b border-white/5 flex flex-col gap-6 dash-elem\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                                <h2 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                    Connections <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-sm font-normal\">(28)</span>\n                                </h2>\n                                <div class=\"relative group\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" class=\"absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-zinc-500\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search apps...\" class=\"pl-9 pr-4 py-1.5 bg-black/40 border border-white/10 rounded-full text-xs text-zinc-300 focus:outline-none focus:border-white/20 w-48 transition-all\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tabs -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-1 no-scrollbar\">\n                                <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-[#ff5a1f]/10 text-[#ff5a1f] text-xs font-normal border border-[#ff5a1f]/20\">All</button>\n                                <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-zinc-200 text-xs font-normal transition\">Active</button>\n                                <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-zinc-200 text-xs font-normal transition\">Inactive</button>\n                                <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-zinc-200 text-xs font-normal transition border border-white/5\">Analytics</button>\n                                <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-zinc-200 text-xs font-normal transition border border-white/5\">Security</button>\n                                <button class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-transparent text-zinc-400 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-zinc-200 text-xs font-normal transition border border-white/5\">Billing</button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Content Grid -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-8 no-scrollbar\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 dash-elem\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white\">Trending</h3>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600\">(6)</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n\n                                <!-- Card 1: CodeHub (Active) -->\n                                <div class=\"border-gradient-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 dash-card\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/80 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" class=\"text-white\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div>\n                                                <h4 class=\"text-base font-normal text-white\">CodeHub</h4>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 border border-white/5 text-[10px] text-zinc-300 font-normal tracking-wide\">DevOps</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                                        AI-powered platform that allows developers to create, store, manage and collaborate on code efficiently.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon> Setup\n                                        </a>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <span class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-300\">Active</span>\n                                            <!-- Custom Toggle ON -->\n                                            <div class=\"w-9 h-5 bg-[#ff5a1f] rounded-full relative cursor-pointer shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,90,31,0.4)] border border-[#ff5a1f]\">\n                                                <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-white rounded-full absolute right-1 top-0.5 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Card 2: LedgerX (Inactive) -->\n                                <div class=\"border-gradient-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 dash-card\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/80 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calculator-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div>\n                                                <h4 class=\"text-base font-normal text-white\">LedgerX</h4>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 border border-white/5 text-[10px] text-zinc-300 font-normal tracking-wide\">Finance</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                                        Comprehensive accounting software package developed to manage invoicing, payroll, and cash flow.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon> Setup\n                                        </a>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <span class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500\">Disabled</span>\n                                            <!-- Custom Toggle OFF -->\n                                            <div class=\"w-9 h-5 bg-zinc-800 rounded-full relative cursor-pointer border border-white/10\">\n                                                <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-zinc-400 rounded-full absolute left-1 top-0.5 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Card 3: RepoSync (Active) -->\n                                <div class=\"border-gradient-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 dash-card\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/80 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:branching-paths-up-linear\" class=\"text-orange-400\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div>\n                                                <h4 class=\"text-base font-normal text-white\">RepoSync</h4>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 border border-white/5 text-[10px] text-zinc-300 font-normal tracking-wide\">Popular</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                                        Open-core company that operates a DevOps software package to develop, secure, and operate software.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon> Setup\n                                        </a>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <span class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-300\">Active</span>\n                                            <!-- Custom Toggle ON -->\n                                            <div class=\"w-9 h-5 bg-[#ff5a1f] rounded-full relative cursor-pointer shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,90,31,0.4)] border border-[#ff5a1f]\">\n                                                <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-white rounded-full absolute right-1 top-0.5 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Card 4: Gatherly (Inactive) -->\n                                <div class=\"border-gradient-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-4 dash-card\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/80 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:calendar-mark-linear\" class=\"text-rose-400\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div>\n                                                <h4 class=\"text-base font-normal text-white\">Gatherly</h4>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 border border-white/5 text-[10px] text-zinc-300 font-normal tracking-wide\">Events</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n                                        Global event management and ticketing platform allowing users to browse, create, and promote events.\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon> Setup\n                                        </a>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                            <span class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500\">Disabled</span>\n                                            <!-- Custom Toggle OFF -->\n                                            <div class=\"w-9 h-5 bg-zinc-800 rounded-full relative cursor-pointer border border-white/10\">\n                                                <div class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-zinc-400 rounded-full absolute left-1 top-0.5 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            // Register GSAP plugins\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- 1. Text Splitting for Masked Reveal ---\n            const titleEl = document.getElementById(\"hero-title\");\n            const words = titleEl.innerText.trim().split(\" \");\n            titleEl.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const maskSpan = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                maskSpan.className = \"reveal-mask\";\n                maskSpan.innerHTML = `<span class=\"reveal-word\">${word}&nbsp;</span>`;\n                titleEl.appendChild(maskSpan);\n            });\n\n            // --- 2. GSAP Animations ---\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power4.out\" } });\n\n            // Reveal words\n            tl.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Fade in other hero elements\n            tl.fromTo(\".hero-elem\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 20 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1 },\n                \"-=0.8\"\n            );\n\n            // Animate logos\n            tl.fromTo(\".logo-anim-elem\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 15 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.1 },\n                \"-=0.6\"\n            );\n\n            // Animate dashboard container entrance\n            tl.fromTo(\".dashboard-plane\",\n                { opacity: 0, z: -200, rotationX: 45 },\n                { opacity: 1, z: 0, rotationX: 38, duration: 1.5, ease: \"expo.out\" },\n                \"-=0.6\"\n            );\n\n            // Stagger dashboard internal elements\n            tl.fromTo(\".dash-elem\",\n                { opacity: 0, x: -10 },\n                { opacity: 1, x: 0, duration: 0.6, stagger: 0.1 },\n                \"-=1.0\"\n            );\n\n            // Stagger cards popping up\n            tl.fromTo(\".dash-card\",\n                { opacity: 0, y: 30, scale: 0.95 },\n                { opacity: 1, y: 0, scale: 1, duration: 0.8, stagger: 0.1, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\" },\n                \"-=0.8\"\n            );\n\n            // Pulse God Ray subtly\n            gsap.to(\"#god-ray\", {\n                opacity: 0.3,\n                scale: 1.05,\n                duration: 4,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // --- 3. ScrollTrigger: Straighten Dashboard ---\n            gsap.to(\".dashboard-plane\", {\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \".perspective-container\",\n                    start: \"top 30%\", // Starts animating when top of container is 30% from top of viewport\n                    end: \"bottom 80%\", // Finishes animating further down\n                    scrub: 1, // Smoothly scrubs the animation\n                },\n                rotationX: 0,\n                rotationY: 0,\n                rotationZ: 0,\n                scale: 1,\n                ease: \"power1.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // --- 4. WebGL Background (Three.js) ---\n            const initWebGL = () => {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-bg');\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n                camera.position.z = 30;\n                camera.position.y = 10;\n                camera.rotation.x = -0.2;\n\n                // Create a wireframe terrain plane\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(100, 100, 40, 40);\n                const material = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                    color: 0xffffff,\n                    wireframe: true,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.03\n                });\n                const plane = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n                plane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\n                scene.add(plane);\n\n                // Store original vertices for wave animation\n                const positions = plane.geometry.attributes.position;\n                const originalZ = [];\n                for (let i = 0; i < positions.count; i++) {\n                    originalZ.push(positions.getZ(i));\n                }\n\n                let time = 0;\n                const animate = () => {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    time += 0.005;\n\n                    // Animate vertices to create gentle flowing waves\n                    for (let i = 0; i < positions.count; i++) {\n                        const x = positions.getX(i);\n                        const y = positions.getY(i);\n                        const wave1 = Math.sin(x * 0.1 + time) * 2;\n                        const wave2 = Math.cos(y * 0.1 + time * 0.8) * 2;\n                        positions.setZ(i, originalZ[i] + wave1 + wave2);\n                    }\n                    positions.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                    // Slowly rotate entire plane\n                    plane.rotation.z = time * 0.1;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                };\n\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                });\n            };\n\n            initWebGL();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-unified-systems-3.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-unified-systems-3.jpg", "source_name": "platform-unified-systems-3-DESIGN.md", "views": 140, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:38:00.385857+00:00"}